Beta4 interpolation transplant
==============================
Base project: minecart-speed-features-1.21.1 Fabric template
Logic source: mbh-1.21.1-beta4-interpolation(1)
New Java root package: ilostmy_fish
Mod id: minecart-speed-features
Version: 2.0.0-test4

Source-set layout:
- src/main/java/ilostmy_fish/... contains shared state, rail logic, visual-path data,
  GameRulesMixin, and AbstractMinecartEntityMixin.
- src/client/java/ilostmy_fish/client/mixin/... contains CameraMixin and
  EntityRendererMixin.
- No Fabric main/client entrypoint is declared; beta4 is mixin-driven.

Intentionally not converted yet:
- Minecraft intermediary class_/method_ mappings.
- @Mixin(remap = false) and descriptor strings using intermediary names.

The compile-stubs, smoke-test harness, and build-direct.sh from the standalone MBH
archive were not copied into the Fabric template because they are standalone build/test
scaffolding, not Fabric/Loom project sources.
